    "title": "Smart AI-Enabled Rapid Feed and Silage Quality Testing System",
    "domain": "Agriculture AI / FoodTech",
    "summary": "This proposal details SIH26111, a low-cost, hybrid hardware-software system designed for real-time feed and silage quality testing. It utilizes a custom INR 1,500 imaging box with an ESP32-CAM to capture standardized samples analyzed by YOLOv8 and EfficientNet models.",
